  "name": "Utilities",
  "description": "A cross-platform C++ system utility library providing foundational abstractions for networking, concurrency, and data serialization. It features a robust socket implementation with WebSocket handshake support, an asynchronous I/O worker pattern, and thread-safe synchronization primitives. The library also includes cryptographic hashing via OpenSSL and WinCrypt, along with custom dynamic array and bit-stream buffers designed for high-performance data handling.",
